Woh! Clash! Into the rolling morning

846
00:58:57,363 --> 00:58:59,963
Flash! I'm in the coolest driver's high

847
00:58:59,963 --> 00:59:03,963
鋼の翼で 駆けぬけよ時間切れまで
With steel wings, until my time's up let's keep breaking through,

848
00:59:03,963 --> 00:59:07,663
生まれつきのスピード狂なのさ
'cuz I was born speed crazy!

849
00:59:27,663 --> 00:59:32,163
もう数えるくらいで僕らは消し失せて真摯な朝が来るね
Soon enough we'll be no more and a pitch black morning will come,

850
00:59:32,163 --> 00:59:38,663
お気に入りの服に さきがえたなら駆け出して!
so get in your favorite clothes and we'll take off!

851
00:59:46,163 --> 00:59:48,963
あきれるほど声を上げて大気圏を突破しようぜ
Raise your voice as high as you can and break through the atmosphere!

852
00:59:48,963 --> 00:59:52,163
Woh! Clash! Into the rolling morning

853
00:59:52,163 --> 00:59:57,163
Flash! I'm in the coolest driver's high

854
01:00:00,378 --> 01:00:03,278
熱くなった銀のメタリックハート
My silver, metallic heart heated up,

855
01:00:03,278 --> 01:00:04,278
導火線に火をつけてあげる
I'll light the fuse for you.

856
