967
01:10:57,181 --> 01:11:01,531
え？直筆サインが欲しい？もう、なんとあります！
Eh? You want a handwritten signature? Well, surprise, we actually have it!

968
01:11:02,021 --> 01:11:07,051
そんなあなたに数量限定バージョンを是非ゲットしてください！
For those of you, please be sure to get the quantity-limited version!

969
01:11:07,051 --> 01:11:09,321
