Trapped in a monochrome world, her heart

981
01:12:17,592 --> 01:12:23,202
様々な花達や、お客さんとの触れ合いを経て
through various flowers and interactions with customers

982
01:12:23,202 --> 01:12:32,162
当たり前の日常はいつも自分のそばにあって、何よりも大切、ということに気づきました。
realized that ordinary daily life is always by her side, and is more precious than anything else.

983
01:12:33,612 --> 01:12:37,612
そんな大切な、たくさんの思い出の中で
Amidst all those precious, numerous memories,

984
